::  Digraph-table sample -- face=lit rows cord (glow-language).
::  Exact match_rune2 order; twin fixture
::  tools/fixtures/g/glow_digraph_table.txt.
=/  a  '+$ $% $: ^- =/ =. =* |+ |- |% |= |^'
=/  b  '++ -- /+ ?: ?> ?< ?- ?~ ?& ?| :- :+ :^ :~'
=/  c  '%- %+ %^ %*'
rows=(weld a (weld ' ' (weld b (weld ' ' c))))
